<title>USA: Howard County, Ind., bonds free to trade.</title>
<headline>Howard County, Ind., bonds free to trade.</headline>
<text>
<p>HOWARD COUNTY REDEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $13,055,000</p>
<p>ECONOMIC REDEVELOPMENT INCOME TAX</p>
<p>LEASE RENTAL REVENUE BONDS OF 1996</p>
<p>WRITTEN AWARD RECEIVED.</p>
<p>EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY THE BONDS ARE FREE TO TRADE.</p>
<p>First Chicago Capital Markets, Inc.</p>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons, Inc.</p>
<p>Edward D. Jones &amp; Co.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
